        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 405, Classic Melon Solid Brass Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSophistication is not neglected by this solid brass door knob. In fact, its simple elegance is best used where rich details are desired. The ridges along the handle grant this 405 Omnia made knob latchset just enough detail without being garish. Available in 6 finishes as a passage, privacy or dummy function. Easy to install, this knobset made by Omnia will fit 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\" or 2\" door thicknesses with 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAll critical interior parts are made of brass. Tough, non-rusting materials are used throughout. All dimensions are standard to fit existing bores for easy replacement installations.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Classic Melon Door Knob With Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>28 degrees rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose covers 2-1/8\" bore hole.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass construction.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 405 Traditional Door Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", or 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> for Omnia 405/60 Elegant Solid Brass Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A stationary knob for use as a pull or to match trim on one side of door. Includes 1 knob, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A stationary knob for use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of door. Includes 2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door by using a 7mm solid spindle. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages\r\n privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy and retract latchbolt. Uses 7mm split spindle. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Elegant Melon Knobset, Omnia 405/60",
                "description": "Omnia 405/60 Melon Door Knob - Sophistication is not neglected by this solid brass door knob. In fact, its simple elegance is best used where rich details are desired. The ridges along the handle grant this 405 Omnia made knob latchset just enough detail without being garish. Available in 6 finishes as a passage, privacy or dummy function. Easy to install, this knobset made by Omnia will fit 1-3/8 inch, 1-3/4 inch or 2 inch door thicknesses with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
                "keywords": "Omnia 405/60 Door Knob Latchsets, OMN-405/60, traditional door knobs, Solid brass door knobs, Elegant doorknobs, ornate latchsets, melon door knobs, Omnia elegant door latchsets, Omnia 405 solid brass door knobs, classic knobs, traditional knobs,"
